00:17:47.452 --> 00:17:55.377
<v Priya Nair>Agreed. No marketing notifications between 9 PM and 8 AM, but order updates are always sent.</v>

99
00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.438
<v Priya Nair>Sixth, substitutions.</v>

100
00:17:57.766 --> 00:18:10.378
<v Priya Nair>When an item is out of stock, the picker in the store suggests a replacement, and the customer can approve or reject it in the app.</v>

