109
00:19:46.563 --> 00:20:00.193
<v Priya Nair>Then the quality requirements we already mentioned: the app loads in under two seconds on 4G, 99.5 percent crash-free sessions, and it must meet WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility.</v>

110
